{"3787340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trials of Valor", "steam_appid": 3787340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.poster.avif?t=1786449484\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.webm?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.mp4?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This roguelike fighter blends RPG elements with fast, skill-based combat. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path across a board game-style map. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, collect gear and face powerful bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master attacking, evading and blocking to overcome every challenge in this unforgiving world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.poster.avif?t=1786449484\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.webm?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.mp4?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map content, gear modifiers and encounters change every run. Build your character from randomized choices of abilities, equipment and charms to come up with interesting combinations, or to create overpowered builds.      <br>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb ascensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has 10 increasingly difficult Ascension levels to beat. Complete Ascensions to unluck unique charms for future runs and earn exclusive cosmetic armor pieces to show off your veteran status.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Mode [NEW IN 2.0]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many waves you can survive in the new Endless Mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade crafting stations in your own camp to gain the advantage in fights. Be prepared, the enemies grow stronger after each Elite Encounter!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you're up against</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with different paths and biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless Mode where you upgrade your camp to survive the increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ character stats that affect how your character performs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large pool of selectable abilities with unique choices for each character class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless weapons and gear pieces to equip, each with random modifiers every time they are created. The same sword can fit two very different playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ charms to increase your chance of victory, some even change the rules of the game entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main classes and 7 subclasses to unlock!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try the game or wishlist it now!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.poster.avif?t=1786449484\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.webm?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.mp4?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This roguelike fighter blends RPG elements with fast, skill-based combat. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path across a board game-style map. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, collect gear and face powerful bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master attacking, evading and blocking to overcome every challenge in this unforgiving world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.poster.avif?t=1786449484\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.webm?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.mp4?t=1786449484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map content, gear modifiers and encounters change every run. Build your character from randomized choices of abilities, equipment and charms to come up with interesting combinations, or to create overpowered builds.      <br>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb ascensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has 10 increasingly difficult Ascension levels to beat. Complete Ascensions to unluck unique charms for future runs and earn exclusive cosmetic armor pieces to show off your veteran status.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Mode [NEW IN 2.0]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many waves you can survive in the new Endless Mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade crafting stations in your own camp to gain the advantage in fights. Be prepared, the enemies grow stronger after each Elite Encounter!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you're up against</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with different paths and biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless Mode where you upgrade your camp to survive the increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ character stats that affect how your character performs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large pool of selectable abilities with unique choices for each character class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless weapons and gear pieces to equip, each with random modifiers every time they are created. The same sword can fit two very different playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ charms to increase your chance of victory, some even change the rules of the game entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main classes and 7 subclasses to unlock!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try the game or wishlist it now!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Fight, block, and evade through the deadly Trials of 